BEAM.com: fine 0.1.6 with no C++ exceptions (-DFINE_NO_EXCEPTIONS), for
a NIF library in WebAssembly (docs/NIFS.md, "C++"). wasm32-wasi links no
__cxa_throw, and WAMR has the exception opcodes only in its classic
interpreter. With the flag, an error of a decoder or of fine::raise is
pending: the NIF function returns, and the wrapper of fine raises it.
Without the flag, the code throws as before. Apply in deps/fine.

